Smart typography dashes and quotes

```
He paused -- then ran --- fast... "Stop!" it's over.
.
<p>He paused – then ran — fast… “Stop!” it’s over.</p>
```

```
a="b"
:"q"
-"q"
/"q"
("q")
.
<p>a=“b”
:“q”
-“q”
/“q”
(“q”)</p>
```

```
}"q"
)"q"
]"q"
."q"
,"q"
a"b
""
.
<p>}”q”
)”q”
]”q”
.”q”
,”q”
a”b
““</p>
```

```
('q')
['q']
='q'
:'q'
-'q'
/'q'
.
<p>(‘q’)
[‘q’]
=‘q’
:‘q’
-‘q’
/‘q’</p>
```

```
{'q'}
.
<p>{‘q’}</p>
```

```
the '70s and '24' and 'word'
.
<p>the ’70s and ’24’ and ‘word’</p>
```

```
a---- b----- c------
.
<p>a–– b—– c——</p>
```

```
a------- b-------- c---------- d----------- e-------------
.
<p>a—–– b–––– c––––– d———– e———––</p>
```

```
*'q'*

"hello"

"'nested'"

a*'q'*
.
<p><strong>‘q’</strong></p>
<p>“hello”</p>
<p>“‘nested’”</p>
<p>a*’q’*</p>
```

```
He paused, then said
"I will not go," and left.\
'Fine,' she said.

> She said
> "no" twice.

- He said
  "no" twice.

Back in the
'90s it was rare.
.
<p>He paused, then said
“I will not go,” and left.<br>
‘Fine,’ she said.</p>
<blockquote><p>She said
“no” twice.</p></blockquote>
<ul>
  <li>He said
“no” twice.</li>
</ul>
<p>Back in the
’90s it was rare.</p>
```

```
'tis the season to be 'jolly'
.
<p>’tis the season to be ‘jolly’</p>
```

```
"Wait---" he said.
.
<p>“Wait—” he said.</p>
```

```
he said---"Go" and replied–"Now".
.
<p>he said—“Go” and replied–“Now”.</p>
```

```
end-"

end-".

end-'!
.
<p>end-”</p>
<p>end-”.</p>
<p>end-’!</p>
```

```
'tis 'em 'twasn't
.
<p>’tis ’em ’twasn’t</p>
```

```
'TIS 'tisn 'twas 'twasn 'twere 'twill 'twould 'cause 'til 'n 'bout

say 'tissue'
.
<p>’TIS ’tisn ’twas ’twasn ’twere ’twill ’twould ’cause ’til ’n ’bout</p>
<p>say ‘tissue’</p>
```

```
'n' and 'em' and 'tis'
.
<p>‘n’ and ‘em’ and ‘tis’</p>
```

```
'em'2
.
<p>’em’2</p>
```

```
'tis Jane's dog
.
<p>’tis Jane’s dog</p>
```

```
'I told 'em so,' he said.
.
<p>‘I told ’em so,’ he said.</p>
```

```
'I said 'hello there,' she replied.
.
<p>‘I said ’hello there,’ she replied.</p>
```

```
say 'word
.
<p>say ’word</p>
```

```
'word
.
<p>‘word</p>
```

```
"'word
.
<p>“‘word</p>
```

```
say '*bold* text
.
<p>say ‘<strong>bold</strong> text</p>
```

```
'Jane's '90s dog and 'word'
.
<p>‘Jane’s ’90s dog and ’word’</p>
```

```
'I *said 'hello* there,' she replied.
.
<p>‘I <strong>said ’hello</strong> there,’ she replied.</p>
```

```
'one

say 'two'
.
<p>‘one</p>
<p>say ‘two’</p>
```

```
say ^['note] 'two'
.
<p>say <a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a> ‘two’</p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>‘note<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
'one ^[say 'note] 'two'
.
<p>‘one <a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a> ’two’</p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>say ’note<a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
"Wait---{%%}" he said.
.
<p>“Wait—” he said.</p>
```

```
“'word'” and ‘"word"’
.
<p>“‘word’” and ‘“word”’</p>
```
